							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "udG3ISQ7QkaB5PYHnrqq8g=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "The smallest report, as a sketch (accessors and views left out):\n\n```smalltalk\nObject << #GtExampleDataReport\n\tslots: { #values . #imageData . #reportUid };\n\tpackage: 'GToolkit-Utility-SpaceTally'\n\nGtExampleDataReport >> initialize\n\tsuper initialize.\n\tvalues := #().\n\timageData := GtReportImageData new.\n\treportUid := UUID new\n\nGtExampleDataReport >> reportType\n\t^ 'example-data'\n\nGtExampleDataReport >> writeFilesTo: anEntry\n\tanEntry writeJsonOf: self\n\nGtExampleDataReport >> storeIn: aStore\n\t^ aStore store: self\n\nGtExampleDataReport class >> leJsonV4Name\n\t^ #gtExampleDataReport\n\nGtExampleDataReport class >> fromStoredFiles: aStoredReportFiles\n\t^ aStoredReportFiles readJson\n```"
						}
					]
				},
